            "liquid": "{% comment %}\n  Bloc réassurance produit — Avisi\n  À coller dans un bloc « Liquid personnalisé » sous le bouton d’ajout au panier.\n  Modifiez les textes, couleurs et dimensions dans la zone PARAMÈTRES ci-dessous.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% liquid\n  assign avisi_item_1 = \"Livraison 48H Offerte. (Expédié depuis la France)\"\n  assign avisi_item_2 = \"Retours gratuits sous 30 jours.\"\n  assign avisi_item_3 = \"Garantie 2 Ans Satisfaction MetaShopper.\"\n\n  assign avisi_outer_background = \"#F5F5F5\"\n  assign avisi_row_background = \"#E7E7E7\"\n  assign avisi_text_color = \"#353535\"\n  assign avisi_icon_color = \"#202020\"\n\n  assign avisi_outer_radius = 16\n  assign avisi_row_radius = 12\n  assign avisi_row_gap = 12\n%}\n\n<div\n  class=\"avisi-product-reassurance\"\n  style=\"\n    --avisi-outer-bg: {{ avisi_outer_background }};\n    --avisi-row-bg: {{ avisi_row_background }};\n    --avisi-text: {{ avisi_text_color }};\n    --avisi-icon: {{ avisi_icon_color }};\n    --avisi-outer-radius: {{ avisi_outer_radius }}px;\n    --avisi-row-radius: {{ avisi_row_radius }}px;\n    --avisi-row-gap: {{ avisi_row_gap }}px;\n  \"\n  aria-label=\"Avantages de votre commande\"\n>\n  <div class=\"avisi-product-reassurance__item\">\n    <div class=\"avisi-product-reassurance__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\">\n        <path d=\"M3 5.5h11v10H3z\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M14 9h3.7l3.3 3.5v3H14z\"></path>\n        <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"1.8\"></circle>\n        <circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"1.8\"></circle>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>{{ avisi_item_1 }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"avisi-product-reassurance__item\">\n    <div class=\"avisi-product-reassurance__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\">\n        <path d=\"M9.5 6 4 11.5 9.5 17\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M4.5 11.5H15a5 5 0 1 0 0-10\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>{{ avisi_item_2 }}</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"avisi-product-reassurance__item\">\n    <div class=\"avisi-product-reassurance__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\">\n        <path d=\"m12 2.5 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1-5.4-2.9-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 9l6.1-.9z\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>{{ avisi_item_3 }}</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .avisi-product-reassurance {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: var(--avisi-row-gap);\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    padding: 18px;\n    background: var(--avisi-outer-bg);\n    border-radius: var(--avisi-outer-radius);\n  }\n\n  .avisi-product-reassurance *,\n  .avisi-product-reassurance *::before,\n  .avisi-product-reassurance *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .avisi-product-reassurance__item {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr);\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    min-height: 54px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    background: var(--avisi-row-bg);\n    border-radius: var(--avisi-row-radius);\n  }\n\n  .avisi-product-reassurance__icon {\n    display: grid;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    place-items: center;\n    color: var(--avisi-icon);\n  }\n\n  .avisi-product-reassurance__icon svg {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    overflow: visible;\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: currentColor;\n    stroke-linecap: round;\n    stroke-linejoin: round;\n    stroke-width: 1.35;\n  }\n\n  .avisi-product-reassurance__item p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: var(--avisi-text);\n    font: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .avisi-product-reassurance {\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin-top: 14px;\n      padding: 12px;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .avisi-product-reassurance__item {\n      grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr);\n      gap: 12px;\n      min-height: 52px;\n      padding: 11px 12px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .avisi-product-reassurance__item p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
